Provides: software-properties-gtk,
Description: Software Sources configuration tool for Debian
 Configure the sources for installable software and updates on Debian
 and Debian Menta:
  * choose a Debian mirror, the archive components (main, contrib,
    non-free, non-free-firmware) and the update suites (security,
    updates, backports, proposed-updates)
  * enable source code and debug symbol repositories
  * manage third party repositories and their authentication keys
  * fix common APT problems and find foreign packages
 .
 The official repositories are kept in deb822 format in
 /etc/apt/sources.list.d/debian.sources.
